# ADRs

- Store ADRs in repository-root `adr/` only.
- Filename pattern: `adr-NNNN-[title-slug].md` (4-digit sequence).
- Use the `create-architectural-decision-record` skill in `.agents/skills/create-architectural-decision-record/`.
- Do not rewrite accepted decisions without documenting status changes.
